                    <span>Critical Risk Zone (>70 Risk Score)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; background: #f97316; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span>
                    <span>Moderate Risk Zone (40 - 70 Score)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; background: #10b981; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                    <span>Designated High-Ground Shelter</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
